From b1a2e58be28d4a02c2e1cef6c9b58197a4b2bf6b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 20:48:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add the shophouse bible and stop collapsing inventories.
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The directory hero no longer sums six papers into “870+ units.”
Onsawangchai’s 1,656, CPB’s 1,960, corridor published counts,
and the Overture review queue stay separate. Working paper 02
and the recovered thesis catalog now live at /rowhouses/bible.
Yaowarat’s ONEP record maps to Plaeng Nam and Wanit–Sampheng;
Luenrit publishes its ICCROM ~220 without adding it to the survey.
