+<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 720 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="t d">
+  <title id="t">Three inventories that do not match</title>
+  <desc id="d">1,656 surveyed shophouse units in Rattanakosin (2001-02); 1,960 CPB heritage shophouse units nationwide in 15 sites; 9,275 OSM footprints in the atlas Old Town layer. Different objects, same city.</desc>
+  <rect width="720" height="300" fill="#f1efe8"/>
